{%- comment -%}
  "90-Day Risk-Free Trial" section: on the left a round guarantee badge, a small orange line, a heading, a short paragraph and a white button; on the right a picture of a person standing at the bottom edge. On phones the person goes under the text, centred.
  EDIT YOUR CONTENT BELOW.
  The picture links start as Metabolae's own files so the section is an exact copy straight away.
  Before you go live, download them, upload them to your own store (Content > Files) and paste your links here instead, so they keep working and are yours. Also replace all the wording, because it describes Metabolae's product.
  mb_badge = the round badge above the text. mb_person = the picture on the right (a cut-out person on a see-through background looks best, about 400 by 400).
  mb_link = where the button goes. The original uses # (which jumps to the top of the page). Put a real link there, or #MainContent, to send people somewhere useful.
  mb_bg = section background. mb_accent = the small line above the heading and the button text (Metabolae's orange; use #943434 for your red). mb_heading_color = the heading. mb_text_color = the paragraph.
  These colours are locked, so the theme cannot turn them black.
  Do not use a straight apostrophe (') in the text, use &#39; or a curly one instead.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mb_eyebrow = 'Feel the Difference' -%}
{%- assign mb_heading = '90-Day Risk-Free Trial' -%}
{%- capture mb_desc -%}
If you’re not completely satisfied in your first 90 days, simply return your order for a full refund — no questions asked.
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign mb_button = 'Try Risk-Free Today' -%}
{%- assign mb_link = '#' -%}
{%- assign mb_badge = 'https://metabolae.com/cdn/shop/files/metabolae-90-day-money-back.webp?v=1773612119&width=200' -%}
{%- assign mb_badge_alt = 'Money-back guarantee badge' -%}
{%- assign mb_person = 'https://metabolae.com/cdn/shop/files/metabolae-90-day-personv2.webp?v=1784724924&width=600' -%}
{%- assign mb_person_alt = '90-Day Risk-Free Trial' -%}
{%- assign mb_bg = '#fdf2e9' -%}
{%- assign mb_accent = '#b85c2a' -%}
{%- assign mb_heading_color = '#1a1a1a' -%}
{%- assign mb_text_color = '#555555' -%}

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" as="style" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" onload="this.onload=null;this.rel='stylesheet'">
<noscript><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600&display=swap"></noscript>

<style>
.page-width:has(>.mb-rf){max-width:none;padding:0}
.mb-rf,.mb-rf *,.mb-rf *::before,.mb-rf *::after{box-sizing:border-box}
.mb-rf{position:relative;display:block;margin:0;padding:45px 0 0;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.8;letter-spacing:.6px;text-align:left}
@media screen and (min-width:750px){.mb-rf{padding-top:60px;font-size:16px}}
.mb-rf .mb-rf__in{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;align-items:end;gap:40px;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}
.mb-rf .mb-rf__c{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;align-self:center;gap:12px;max-width:540px;margin:0 auto;padding-bottom:40px;text-align:center}
.mb-rf .mb-rf__bd{display:block;width:152px;max-width:none;height:auto;margin:0 0 4px;border:0}
.mb-rf .mb-rf__ey{margin:0;padding:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}
.mb-rf .mb-rf__h{margin:0;padding:0;font-family:Poppins,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(26px,3.5vw,40px);font-style:normal;font-weight:400!important;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.01em;text-align:center;text-transform:none}
.mb-rf .mb-rf__d{margin:0;padding:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:400!important;line-height:1.65;text-align:center}
.mb-rf .mb-rf__d strong{font-weight:700!important}
.mb-rf .mb-rf__cta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:16px}
.mb-rf .mb-rf__bt{display:inline-block;padding:16px 48px;border:none;border-radius:30px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.15);transition:transform .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease,opacity .2s ease}
.mb-rf .mb-rf__bt:hover{transform:scale(1.02);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.2);opacity:.95}
.mb-rf .mb-rf__bt:active{transform:scale(.98)}
.mb-rf .mb-rf__iw{display:flex;flex-shrink:0;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:flex-end;align-self:end;width:400px;height:400px;overflow:hidden}
.mb-rf .mb-rf__pi{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;max-width:none;border:0;object-fit:contain;object-position:bottom center}
.mb-rf .mb-rf__ey,.mb-rf .mb-rf__bt{color:var(--mb-rf-ac)!important;-webkit-text-fill-color:var(--mb-rf-ac)!important}
.mb-rf .mb-rf__h{color:var(--mb-rf-hc)!important;-webkit-text-fill-color:var(--mb-rf-hc)!important}
.mb-rf .mb-rf__d,.mb-rf .mb-rf__d strong{color:var(--mb-rf-tx)!important;-webkit-text-fill-color:var(--mb-rf-tx)!important}
@media screen and (max-width:749px){
.mb-rf .mb-rf__in{grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-template-rows:auto auto;gap:24px;padding:0 24px}
.mb-rf .mb-rf__c{align-items:center;max-width:100%;padding-bottom:0;text-align:center}
.mb-rf .mb-rf__iw{justify-content:center;width:100%;height:320px;overflow:visible}
.mb-rf .mb-rf__pi{width:auto;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain}
}
</style>

<div class="mb-rf" style="--mb-rf-ac:{{ mb_accent }};--mb-rf-hc:{{ mb_heading_color }};--mb-rf-tx:{{ mb_text_color }};background:{{ mb_bg }}!important">
  <div class="mb-rf__in">
    <div class="mb-rf__c">
      <img class="mb-rf__bd" src="{{ mb_badge }}" alt="{{ mb_badge_alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="152">
      <p class="mb-rf__ey">{{ mb_eyebrow }}</p>
      <h2 class="mb-rf__h">{{ mb_heading }}</h2>
      <p class="mb-rf__d">{{ mb_desc | strip }}</p>
      <div class="mb-rf__cta">
        <a href="{{ mb_link }}" class="mb-rf__bt" style="background:#fff!important">{{ mb_button }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mb-rf__iw">
      <img class="mb-rf__pi" src="{{ mb_person }}" alt="{{ mb_person_alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="400">
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
